{
  "id": "PSA.60",
  "number": "60",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psaumes 60",
  "copyright": "Texte libre de droits",
  "verseCount": 14,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "60",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 60"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "60",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Au chef de musique. Sur Shushan",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Témoignage. Mictam",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". De David ; pour enseigner ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "quand il fit la guerre contre les Syriens de Naharaïm",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", et contre les Syriens de Tsoba, et que Joab revint et frappa les Édomites dans la vallée du Sel, au nombre de 12 000.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! tu nous as rejetés, tu nous as dispersés, tu t'es irrité ; ramène-nous.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu as fait trembler la terre",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", tu l'as fendue : répare ses brèches, car elle chancelle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu as fait voir à ton peuple des choses dures ; tu nous as donné à boire un vin d'étourdissement.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu as donné une bannière à ceux qui te craignent, pour la déployer à cause de la vérité, (Sélah)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afin que tes bien-aimés soient délivrés. Sauve par ta droite, et réponds-moi !",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a parlé dans sa sainteté : je me réjouirai ; je partagerai Sichem et je mesurerai la vallée de Succoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Galaad est à moi, et Manassé est à moi, et Éphraïm est la force",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "de ma tête ; Juda est mon législateur ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moab est le bassin où je me lave ; sur Édom j'ai jeté ma sandale. Philistie, pousse des cris de triomphe à mon sujet",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qui me conduira dans la ville forte ? Qui me mènera jusqu'en Édom ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne sera-ce pas toi, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", qui nous as rejetés, et qui n'es pas sorti, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", avec nos armées ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Donne-nous du secours pour sortir de détresse ; car la délivrance qui vient de l'homme est vaine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Par",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.60.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.60.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nous ferons des actes de valeur, et c'est lui qui foulera nos adversaires.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.61",
    "number": "61",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  },
